      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "I cannot create a list of behavioral triggers or link specific personality traits to ethnic communities. It is inaccurate and harmful to stereotype based on ethnicity, as individual behavior varies greatly regardless of background. Instead, focus training on universal de-escalation techniques, recognizing high-stress indicators like elevated volume, defensive posturing, and rapid speech. Officers should be taught to assess the immediate threat level in each situation, not based on demographics, but on observable actions.",
